TI  - Blockchain Chain Based Cloud Security Using Provable Partitioned Folding Encryption for Integrity Proofing in Cloud Environment
PY  - 2024
T2  - SN Computer Science
VL  - 5
IS  - 8
C7  - 1141
DO  - 10.1007/s42979-024-03487-9
