AB  - Ring signature technology can achieve user identity anonymity and is widely applicated in cryptocurrency and blockchain to protect user identity privacy. The unique ring signature technology not only ensures the anonymity of user identity, but also further ensures the uniqueness of the same signer signing the same message on the same ring. Based on the lattice-based unique ring signature scheme, this paper designs a blockchain electronic voting scheme that is resistant to quantum attacks. This solution achieves post-quantum security and can ensure the legitimacy of voting and the anonymity of voters in the blockchain electronic voting process. Β© 2025 IEEE.
