TI  - Performance Evaluation of a Blockchain-Oriented Secure Validation Mechanism for 5G-Integrated IoT Networks
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - IEEE 10th International Conference on Smart Structures and Systems, ICSSS 2025
