TI  - Security in a Complex Non-deterministic World: Towards a Quantum Secure Industrial Internet "qSII&"
PY  - 2021
T2  - AMSec 2021 - Proceedings of the 2021 Workshop on Additive Manufacturing (3D Printing) Security, co-located with CCS 2021
SP  - 1
EP  - 2
